  "sourceUrl": "https://sironekotoro.hateblo.jp/entry/2014/01/26/124132",
  "html": "<h3>サブルーチン</h3>\n\n<ul>\n<li>「あ！<s>これ進研ゼミ</s><a class=\"keyword\" href=\"http://d.hatena.ne.jp/keyword/Perl\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Perl</a>入学式でやったところだ！」</li>\n<li>ってことで、あまり苦労せずに進むことが出来たでござる。</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<h3>練習問題10-3</h3>\n\n<pre class=\"code lang-perl\" data-lang=\"perl\" data-unlink><span class=\"synStatement\">use strict</span>;\n<span class=\"synStatement\">use warnings</span>;\n\n<span class=\"synStatement\">my</span> <span class=\"synIdentifier\">@data</span> = ( <span class=\"synConstant\">'How'</span>, <span class=\"synConstant\">'I'</span>, <span class=\"synConstant\">'wonder'</span>, <span class=\"synConstant\">'what'</span>, <span class=\"synConstant\">'you'</span>, <span class=\"synConstant\">'are.'</span>, <span class=\"synConstant\">''</span> );\n<span class=\"synStatement\">print</span> <span class=\"synStatement\">join</span>( <span class=\"synConstant\">', '</span>, <span class=\"synIdentifier\">&amp;get_length_list</span>(<span class=\"synIdentifier\">@data</span>) ), <span class=\"synConstant\">\"</span><span class=\"synSpecial\">\\n</span><span class=\"synConstant\">\"</span>;\n\n<span class=\"synStatement\">sub </span><span class=\"synIdentifier\">get_length_list </span>{\n    <span class=\"synStatement\">my</span> <span class=\"synIdentifier\">@word_list</span> = <span class=\"synIdentifier\">@_</span>;\n    <span class=\"synStatement\">my</span> <span class=\"synIdentifier\">@word_count</span>;\n    <span class=\"synStatement\">for</span> <span class=\"synStatement\">my</span> <span class=\"synIdentifier\">$i</span> (<span class=\"synIdentifier\">@word_list</span>) {\n        <span class=\"synStatement\">push</span> <span class=\"synIdentifier\">@word_count</span>, <span class=\"synStatement\">length</span> <span class=\"synIdentifier\">$i</span>;\n    }\n    <span class=\"synStatement\">return</span> <span class=\"synIdentifier\">@word_count</span>;\n}\n</pre>\n\n\n<h3>練習問題10-4</h3>\n\n<pre class=\"code lang-perl\" data-lang=\"perl\" data-unlink><span class=\"synStatement\">use strict</span>;\n<span class=\"synStatement\">use warnings</span>;\n\n<span class=\"synStatement\">print</span> <span class=\"synIdentifier\">&amp;factorial</span>(-<span class=\"synConstant\">1</span>), <span class=\"synConstant\">\"</span><span class=\"synSpecial\">\\n</span><span class=\"synConstant\">\"</span>;\n<span class=\"synStatement\">for</span> ( <span class=\"synStatement\">my</span> <span class=\"synIdentifier\">$n</span> = <span class=\"synConstant\">0</span>; <span class=\"synIdentifier\">$n</span> &lt; <span class=\"synConstant\">10</span>; <span class=\"synIdentifier\">$n</span>++ ) {\n    <span class=\"synStatement\">print</span> <span class=\"synIdentifier\">&amp;factorial</span>(<span class=\"synIdentifier\">$n</span>), <span class=\"synConstant\">\"</span><span class=\"synSpecial\">\\n</span><span class=\"synConstant\">\"</span>;\n}\n<span class=\"synStatement\">print</span> <span class=\"synIdentifier\">&amp;factorial</span>(<span class=\"synConstant\">10.5</span>), <span class=\"synConstant\">\"</span><span class=\"synSpecial\">\\n</span><span class=\"synConstant\">\"</span>;\n\n<span class=\"synStatement\">sub </span><span class=\"synIdentifier\">factorial </span>{\n    <span class=\"synStatement\">my</span> <span class=\"synIdentifier\">$number</span> = <span class=\"synStatement\">shift</span> <span class=\"synIdentifier\">@_</span>;\n    <span class=\"synIdentifier\">$number</span> = <span class=\"synStatement\">int</span> <span class=\"synIdentifier\">$number</span>;\n    <span class=\"synStatement\">my</span> <span class=\"synIdentifier\">$fac</span> = <span class=\"synConstant\">1</span>;\n\n    <span class=\"synStatement\">if</span> ( <span class=\"synIdentifier\">$number</span> &lt; <span class=\"synConstant\">0</span> ) {\n        <span class=\"synStatement\">return</span> <span class=\"synConstant\">0</span>;\n    }\n    <span class=\"synStatement\">elsif</span> ( <span class=\"synIdentifier\">$number</span> == <span class=\"synConstant\">0</span> ) {\n        <span class=\"synStatement\">return</span> <span class=\"synConstant\">1</span>;\n    }\n    <span class=\"synStatement\">else</span> {\n        <span class=\"synStatement\">for</span> <span class=\"synStatement\">my</span> <span class=\"synIdentifier\">$i</span> ( <span class=\"synConstant\">1</span> .. <span class=\"synIdentifier\">$number</span> ) {\n            <span class=\"synIdentifier\">$fac</span> *= <span class=\"synIdentifier\">$i</span>;\n        }\n        <span class=\"synStatement\">return</span> <span class=\"synIdentifier\">$fac</span>;\n    }\n}\n</pre>\n\n\n<h3>練習問題10-6</h3>\n\n<pre class=\"code lang-perl\" data-lang=\"perl\" data-unlink><span class=\"synStatement\">use strict</span>;\n<span class=\"synStatement\">use warnings</span>;\n\n<span class=\"synStatement\">my</span> <span class=\"synIdentifier\">@data</span> = <span class=\"synIdentifier\">&amp;get_data</span>;\n<span class=\"synStatement\">print</span> <span class=\"synStatement\">join</span>( <span class=\"synConstant\">', '</span>, <span class=\"synIdentifier\">@data</span> ), <span class=\"synConstant\">\"</span><span class=\"synSpecial\">\\n</span><span class=\"synConstant\">\"</span>;\n\n<span class=\"synStatement\">my</span> <span class=\"synIdentifier\">$data</span> = <span class=\"synIdentifier\">&amp;get_data</span>;\n<span class=\"synStatement\">print</span> <span class=\"synIdentifier\">$data</span>;\n\n<span class=\"synStatement\">sub </span><span class=\"synIdentifier\">get_data </span>{\n    <span class=\"synStatement\">my</span> ( <span class=\"synIdentifier\">$sec</span>, <span class=\"synIdentifier\">$min</span>, <span class=\"synIdentifier\">$hour</span>, <span class=\"synIdentifier\">$day</span>, <span class=\"synIdentifier\">$mon</span>, <span class=\"synIdentifier\">$year</span> ) = <span class=\"synStatement\">localtime</span>;\n    <span class=\"synIdentifier\">$year</span> += <span class=\"synConstant\">1900</span>;\n    <span class=\"synIdentifier\">$mon</span>  += <span class=\"synConstant\">1</span>;\n    <span class=\"synStatement\">unless</span> ( <span class=\"synStatement\">defined</span>(<span class=\"synStatement\">wantarray</span>) ) {\n    }\n    <span class=\"synStatement\">elsif</span> (<span class=\"synStatement\">wantarray</span>) {\n        <span class=\"synStatement\">return</span> ( <span class=\"synIdentifier\">$year</span>, <span class=\"synIdentifier\">$mon</span>, <span class=\"synIdentifier\">$day</span> );\n    }\n    <span class=\"synStatement\">else</span> {\n        <span class=\"synIdentifier\">$mon</span> = <span class=\"synConstant\">'0'</span> . <span class=\"synIdentifier\">$mon</span> <span class=\"synStatement\">if</span> ( <span class=\"synIdentifier\">$mon</span> &lt; <span class=\"synConstant\">10</span> );\n        <span class=\"synIdentifier\">$day</span> = <span class=\"synConstant\">'0'</span> . <span class=\"synIdentifier\">$day</span> <span class=\"synStatement\">if</span> ( <span class=\"synIdentifier\">$day</span> &lt; <span class=\"synConstant\">10</span> );\n        <span class=\"synStatement\">return</span> (<span class=\"synConstant\">\"</span><span class=\"synIdentifier\">$year</span><span class=\"synConstant\">-</span><span class=\"synIdentifier\">$mon</span><span class=\"synConstant\">-</span><span class=\"synIdentifier\">$day</span><span class=\"synConstant\">\"</span>);\n    }\n}\n</pre>\n\n\n-----",
